WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.180
Finding your next home starts with
questions.

2
00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:04.000
What's within budget?

3
00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:06.100
Which area feels right,

4
00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:08.380
and how do you arrange a viewing?

5
00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:13.380
For an estate agent, those conversations
can mean answering the same questions

6
00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:17.080
and gathering the same details again and
again.

7
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.880
Meet the Hayes and Home property
assistant.

8
00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:25.060
Built into the website, it helps visitors
explore homes, ask follow-up

9
00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.700
questions and take the next step through
chat.

10
00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:33.240
Behind the conversation, an AI automation
searches property listings and draws

11
00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:37.520
on a knowledge base, helping visitors
narrow their search without starting

12
00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:37.840
over.

13
00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:39.500
Ready to request a viewing?

14
00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:43.580
The assistant prepares a summary for the
visitor to review and submit.

15
00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:47.600
The request is saved with protection
against duplicate submissions.

16
00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:51.820
Email and SMS notifications bring the
details to Daniel.

17
00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:56.540
And Daniel stays in control, checking
availability and confirming the

18
00:00:56.540 --> 00:00:57.240
appointment himself.

19
00:00:58.140 --> 00:00:59.320
Less repetitive admin.

20
00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:01.020
A clearer handover.

21
00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:04.300
More attention for the people behind each
inquiry.

22
00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:08.900
Mark Automates, a little less admin, a lot
more you.
